                        <th width="10%" style="border: 1px solid black;">Allowed input Tax for the Period**</th>
                        <th width="10%" style="border: 1px solid black;">Balance of input Tax to be carried to Next
                            Period (E) Less (H)</th>
                        <th width="4%" style="border: 1px solid black;">Action</th>
                    </tr>
