            <p class="indentTosa">The BIR is not liable or responsible for any damages, expenses, costs or loss of any
                kind (including, but not limited to, any direct, indirect, special, incidental, or consequential
                damages, financial losses, loss of profits, loss of any data or loss of any opportunity) caused as a
                result (directly or indirectly) of, or in connection with, your use of the Service (including the
                downloads and/or use of the services) or reliance on any information, materials, tools, provided in or
                available from this site.</p>

